{"seq":3,"slug":"async-io-eio","title":"异步 IO 与 Eio","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/advanced-ocaml-programming/concurrency-effects/async-io-eio","wordCount":1126,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"异步-io-与-eio\">异步 IO 与 Eio</h1><p>Eio 是 OCaml 5 的直接风格（direct-style）IO 库，构建在 Effect Handler 之上。它消除了传统异步编程中的「函数着色问题」（function coloring problem）——使用 Eio 的异步代码看起来与同步代码完全相同，无需 <code>&gt;&gt;=</code>、<code>let*</code> 或任何 monadic 语法。截至 2026 年 7 月，Eio 的最新稳定版为 1.3，已被 Docker Desktop、cohttp、capnp-rpc 等项目采用，Tarides 还发布了 <code>ciao-lwt</code> 工具自动化从 Lwt 到 Eio 的迁移。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Eio 把「异步」重新定义为一种可直接书写的普通风格，其设计围绕几条核心命题展开。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>核心命题</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>直接后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>直接风格</td>\n<td>异步代码与同步代码写法完全相同</td>\n<td>无需 <code>&gt;&gt;=</code>/<code>let*</code>，<code>try...with</code> 可直接用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>能力传递</td>\n<td>网络、文件、时钟作为显式参数传入</td>\n<td>依赖可注入、测试无需全局 mock</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结构化并发</td>\n<td>每个 fiber 必须属于某个 Switch</td>\n<td>switch 退出前保证子 fiber 完成或被取消</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平台后端</td>\n<td>核心层与平台特定后端分离</td>\n<td><code>Eio_main.run</code> 自动选择最优 IO 机制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话概括：Eio 用 Effect Handler 把「IO 操作」变成「一种效果」，于是「调度器只是一个 handler」，异步因此不再需要污染函数签名。下面依次展开直接风格与 monadic 风格的对比、Eio 架构、结构化并发、能力传递与迁移实践。</p>\n<h2 id=\"直接风格-vs-monadic-风格\">直接风格 vs Monadic 风格</h2><p>对比 Lwt（monadic 风格）与 Eio（直接风格）实现相同逻辑：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"(* Lwt: 必须用 bind/let* 包装每一步异步操作 *)&#10;let fetch_and_process_lwt url =&#10;  let open Lwt.Syntax in&#10;  let* response = Http_lwt.get url in&#10;  let* body = Http_lwt.body response in&#10;  let* parsed = Parser_lwt.parse body in&#10;  Lwt.return (transform parsed)&#10;&#10;(* Eio: 异步代码与同步代码写法完全相同 *)&#10;let fetch_and_process_eio ~net url =&#10;  let response = Http_eio.get ~net url in&#10;  let body = Http_eio.body response in&#10;  let parsed = Parser.parse body in&#10;  transform parsed\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>(* Lwt: 必须用 bind/let* 包装每一步异步操作 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let fetch_and_process_lwt url =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let open Lwt.Syntax in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let* response = Http_lwt.get url in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let* body = Http_lwt.body response in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let* parsed = Parser_lwt.parse body in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Lwt.return (transform parsed)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* Eio: 异步代码与同步代码写法完全相同 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let fetch_and_process_eio ~net url =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let response = Http_eio.get ~net url in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let body = Http_eio.body response in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let parsed = Parser.parse body in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  transform parsed</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这不仅是语法糖——直接风格的代码可以正常使用 <code>try...with</code>、<code>match</code>、<code>for</code>/<code>while</code> 循环，无需它们的 monadic 对应物：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"(* Eio: 异常处理就是普通的 try...with *)&#10;let safe_fetch ~net url =&#10;  try&#10;    let resp = Http_eio.get ~net url in&#10;    Ok (Http_eio.body resp)&#10;  with&#10;  | Eio.Net.Connection_refused _ -&gt; Error &quot;connection refused&quot;&#10;  | Eio.Cancel.Cancelled _ -&gt; Error &quot;cancelled&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>(* Eio: 异常处理就是普通的 try...with *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let safe_fetch ~net url =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  try</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let resp = Http_eio.get ~net url in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Ok (Http_eio.body resp)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  with</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Eio.Net.Connection_refused _ -> Error \"connection refused\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  | Eio.Cancel.Cancelled _ -> Error \"cancelled\"</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Lwt/Async (Monadic)</th>\n<th>Eio (Direct-style)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>语法</td>\n<td><code>let*</code>/<code>&gt;&gt;=</code> 包装</td>\n<td>普通函数调用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>异常处理</td>\n<td><code>Lwt.catch</code> / 专用 API</td>\n<td>普通 <code>try...with</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>循环</td>\n<td><code>Lwt_list.iter_s</code></td>\n<td>普通 <code>List.iter</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>栈追踪</td>\n<td>不完整（回调丢失上下文）</td>\n<td>完整</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>与标准库兼容</td>\n<td>需 monadic 包装</td>\n<td>直接使用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能</td>\n<td>每步分配 Promise</td>\n<td>零额外分配（Fiber 切换）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"eio-的架构\">Eio 的架构</h2><p>Eio 分为平台无关的核心层和平台特定的后端：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 应用层&#10;        A[用户代码]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Eio 核心&#10;        B[Fiber 调度器]&#10;        C[Switch / 结构化并发]&#10;        D[Flow / Net / FS 接口]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 后端&#10;        E[eio_linux - io_uring]&#10;        F[eio_posix - epoll/kqueue]&#10;        G[eio_windows - IOCP]&#10;    end&#10;    A --&gt; D&#10;    D --&gt; B&#10;    B --&gt; C&#10;    B --&gt; E&#10;    B --&gt; F&#10;    B --&gt; G\">graph TB\n    subgraph 应用层\n        A[用户代码]\n    end\n    subgraph Eio 核心\n        B[Fiber 调度器]\n        C[Switch / 结构化并发]\n        D[Flow / Net / FS 接口]\n    end\n    subgraph 后端\n        E[eio_linux - io_uring]\n        F[eio_posix - epoll/kqueue]\n        G[eio_windows - IOCP]\n    end\n    A --&gt; D\n    D --&gt; B\n    B --&gt; C\n    B --&gt; E\n    B --&gt; F\n    B --&gt; G</pre><p><code>Eio_main.run</code> 自动选择当前平台最优的后端：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"let () = Eio_main.run @@ fun env -&gt;&#10;  let net = Eio.Stdenv.net env in&#10;  let fs = Eio.Stdenv.fs env in&#10;  let clock = Eio.Stdenv.clock env in&#10;  (* env 提供所有系统资源的能力引用 *)&#10;  my_application ~net ~fs ~clock\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>let () = Eio_main.run @@ fun env -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let net = Eio.Stdenv.net env in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let fs = Eio.Stdenv.fs env in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let clock = Eio.Stdenv.clock env in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (* env 提供所有系统资源的能力引用 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  my_application ~net ~fs ~clock</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"结构化并发与-switch\">结构化并发与 Switch</h2><p>Eio 使用 Switch 实现结构化并发（structured concurrency）——所有 fiber 必须属于某个 switch，switch 退出时确保所有子 fiber 已完成或被取消：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"let concurrent_fetch ~net urls =&#10;  Eio.Switch.run @@ fun sw -&gt;&#10;    let fibers = List.map (fun url -&gt;&#10;      Eio.Fiber.fork_promise ~sw (fun () -&gt;&#10;        Http_eio.get ~net url |&gt; Http_eio.body&#10;      )&#10;    ) urls in&#10;    List.map Eio.Promise.await_exn fibers&#10;&#10;(* Switch 保证：&#10;   - 所有 fork 出的 fiber 在 switch 退出前完成&#10;   - 任何 fiber 抛出未处理异常会取消同 switch 内所有 fiber&#10;   - 没有 fiber 泄漏（orphan fiber） *)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>let concurrent_fetch ~net urls =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Eio.Switch.run @@ fun sw -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let fibers = List.map (fun url -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      Eio.Fiber.fork_promise ~sw (fun () -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Http_eio.get ~net url |> Http_eio.body</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ) urls in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    List.map Eio.Promise.await_exn fibers</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* Switch 保证：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>   - 所有 fork 出的 fiber 在 switch 退出前完成</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>   - 任何 fiber 抛出未处理异常会取消同 switch 内所有 fiber</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>   - 没有 fiber 泄漏（orphan fiber） *)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>取消传播机制：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"let with_timeout ~clock duration f =&#10;  Eio.Switch.run @@ fun sw -&gt;&#10;    let timer = Eio.Fiber.fork ~sw (fun () -&gt;&#10;      Eio.Time.sleep clock duration;&#10;      raise (Failure &quot;timeout&quot;)&#10;    ) in&#10;    let result = f () in&#10;    Eio.Fiber.cancel timer;&#10;    result\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>let with_timeout ~clock duration f =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Eio.Switch.run @@ fun sw -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let timer = Eio.Fiber.fork ~sw (fun () -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      Eio.Time.sleep clock duration;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      raise (Failure \"timeout\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ) in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let result = f () in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Eio.Fiber.cancel timer;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    result</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"能力传递与依赖注入\">能力传递与依赖注入</h2><p>Eio 采用 capability-passing 风格——系统资源（网络、文件系统、时钟）作为显式参数传递，而非全局可用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"(* 函数签名明确声明需要的能力 *)&#10;val fetch_data :&#10;  net:#Eio.Net.t -&gt;&#10;  clock:#Eio.Time.t -&gt;&#10;  string -&gt; (string, error) result&#10;&#10;(* 测试时注入 mock 能力 *)&#10;let test_fetch () =&#10;  Eio_mock.Backend.run @@ fun () -&gt;&#10;    let mock_net = Eio_mock.Net.make &quot;test-net&quot; in&#10;    let mock_clock = Eio_mock.Clock.make () in&#10;    Eio_mock.Net.on_connect mock_net [`Return mock_socket];&#10;    let result = fetch_data ~net:mock_net ~clock:mock_clock &quot;http://test&quot; in&#10;    assert (result = Ok &quot;mocked response&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>(* 函数签名明确声明需要的能力 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val fetch_data :</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  net:#Eio.Net.t -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  clock:#Eio.Time.t -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  string -> (string, error) result</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* 测试时注入 mock 能力 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let test_fetch () =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Eio_mock.Backend.run @@ fun () -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mock_net = Eio_mock.Net.make \"test-net\" in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mock_clock = Eio_mock.Clock.make () in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Eio_mock.Net.on_connect mock_net [`Return mock_socket];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let result = fetch_data ~net:mock_net ~clock:mock_clock \"http://test\" in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    assert (result = Ok \"mocked response\")</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这使得 IO 代码天然可测试——无需全局 mock 框架或依赖注入容器：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>传统方式</th>\n<th>Eio 方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全局 <code>Unix.socket</code></td>\n<td>通过 <code>~net</code> 参数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全局 <code>open_in</code></td>\n<td>通过 <code>~fs</code> 参数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全局 <code>Unix.gettimeofday</code></td>\n<td>通过 <code>~clock</code> 参数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mock 需要全局替换</td>\n<td>构造时注入 mock 对象</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"fiber-间通信\">Fiber 间通信</h2><p>Eio 提供多种 fiber 间同步原语：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"(* Promise: 一次性值传递 *)&#10;let promise_example () =&#10;  Eio.Switch.run @@ fun sw -&gt;&#10;    let promise, resolver = Eio.Promise.create () in&#10;    Eio.Fiber.fork ~sw (fun () -&gt;&#10;      let data = expensive_computation () in&#10;      Eio.Promise.resolve resolver data&#10;    );&#10;    (* 阻塞等待 promise 被填充 *)&#10;    let result = Eio.Promise.await promise in&#10;    process result&#10;&#10;(* Stream: 多值通道 *)&#10;let stream_example () =&#10;  let stream = Eio.Stream.create 10 in  (* 容量 10 的缓冲通道 *)&#10;  Eio.Switch.run @@ fun sw -&gt;&#10;    (* 生产者 *)&#10;    Eio.Fiber.fork ~sw (fun () -&gt;&#10;      for i = 1 to 100 do&#10;        Eio.Stream.add stream i&#10;      done&#10;    );&#10;    (* 消费者 *)&#10;    for _ = 1 to 100 do&#10;      let item = Eio.Stream.take stream in&#10;      Printf.printf &quot;Got: %d\\n&quot; item&#10;    done\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>(* Promise: 一次性值传递 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let promise_example () =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Eio.Switch.run @@ fun sw -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let promise, resolver = Eio.Promise.create () in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Eio.Fiber.fork ~sw (fun () -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      let data = expensive_computation () in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      Eio.Promise.resolve resolver data</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    (* 阻塞等待 promise 被填充 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let result = Eio.Promise.await promise in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    process result</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(* Stream: 多值通道 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let stream_example () =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let stream = Eio.Stream.create 10 in  (* 容量 10 的缓冲通道 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Eio.Switch.run @@ fun sw -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    (* 生产者 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Eio.Fiber.fork ~sw (fun () -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      for i = 1 to 100 do</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Eio.Stream.add stream i</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      done</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    (* 消费者 *)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for _ = 1 to 100 do</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      let item = Eio.Stream.take stream in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      Printf.printf \"Got: %d\\n\" item</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    done</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"多核并行与-eio\">多核并行与 Eio</h2><p>Eio 整合了 Domain 级并行和 Fiber 级并发：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"ocaml\" data-code=\"let parallel_process ~sw ~domain_mgr items =&#10;  let num_domains = Domain.recommended_domain_count () in&#10;  let chunks = chunk_list num_domains items in&#10;  let futures = List.map (fun chunk -&gt;&#10;    Eio.Domain_manager.submit_exn domain_mgr ~sw (fun () -&gt;&#10;      List.map process_item chunk&#10;    )&#10;  ) chunks in&#10;  List.concat_map Eio.Promise.await_exn futures\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>let parallel_process ~sw ~domain_mgr items =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let num_domains = Domain.recommended_domain_count () in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let chunks = chunk_list num_domains items in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let futures = List.map (fun chunk -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Eio.Domain_manager.submit_exn domain_mgr ~sw (fun () -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      List.map process_item chunk</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ) chunks in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  List.concat_map Eio.Promise.await_exn futures</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>Eio.Domain_manager</code> 管理 Domain 池，将计算密集型任务分配到其他 Domain 执行，同时当前 Domain 继续处理 IO fiber——实现真正的「IO 并发 + 计算并行」混合模型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从-lwt-迁移到-eio\">从 Lwt 迁移到 Eio</h2><p>2026 年 3 月 Tarides 发布的 <code>ciao-lwt</code> 工具可以半自动化迁移过程：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 步骤 1: 将 lwt_ppx 语法转为 let 语法&#10;ciao-lwt lwt-ppx-to-let-syntax .&#10;&#10;# 步骤 2: 检查潜在的隐式 fork&#10;ciao-lwt lint .&#10;&#10;# 步骤 3: 将 Lwt bind 转为直接风格&#10;dune build @ocaml-index&#10;ciao-lwt to-eio --migrate .&#10;dune fmt\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 步骤 1: 将 lwt_ppx 语法转为 let 语法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ciao-lwt</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> lwt-ppx-to-let-syntax</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 步骤 2: 检查潜在的隐式 fork</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ciao-lwt</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> lint</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 步骤 3: 将 Lwt bind 转为直接风格</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dune</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> @ocaml-index</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ciao-lwt</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> to-eio</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --migrate</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">dune</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fmt</span></span></code></pre></div><p>迁移后需要手动处理的部分：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>将隐式全局 IO 替换为显式能力传递</li>\n<li>Lwt 的 <code>Lwt.pick</code>/<code>Lwt.choose</code> 替换为 Eio 的 <code>Fiber.any</code>/<code>Fiber.first</code></li>\n<li>确保所有 fiber 都绑定到 Switch（结构化并发要求）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>直接风格消除函数着色</strong>：Eio 的异步代码与同步代码写法相同，<code>try...with</code>、<code>match</code>、循环都无需 monadic 对应物，且栈追踪完整、每步零额外分配。</li>\n<li><strong>架构上核心与后端分离</strong>：平台无关的 Fiber 调度器加 eio_linux（io_uring）、eio_posix（epoll/kqueue）、eio_windows（IOCP）三个后端，<code>Eio_main.run</code> 自动择优。</li>\n<li><strong>结构化并发由 Switch 保证</strong>：所有 fiber 必须属于某个 switch，退出前保证子 fiber 完成或被取消，杜绝 orphan fiber 与泄漏。</li>\n<li><strong>能力传递天然可测试</strong>：网络、文件、时钟作为 <code>~net</code>/<code>~fs</code>/<code>~clock</code> 显式传入，测试时注入 mock 即可，无需全局替换。</li>\n<li><strong>多核与并发整合</strong>：<code>Eio.Domain_manager</code> 把计算密集型任务分发到其它 Domain，当前 Domain 继续处理 IO fiber，实现「IO 并发 + 计算并行」。</li>\n<li><strong>迁移有工具支撑</strong>：Tarides 的 <code>ciao-lwt</code> 可半自动化从 Lwt 迁移，剩余手工作业集中在把隐式全局 IO 改为显式能力、以及确保 fiber 都绑定到 Switch。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Eio 建立在 Effect Handler 提供可组合控制流之上，底层则利用 Domain 与 Fiber 机制——三者共同构成 OCaml 现代并发编程的完整技术栈。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"异步 IO 与 Eio","id":"异步-io-与-eio"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"直接风格 vs Monadic 风格","id":"直接风格-vs-monadic-风格"},{"level":2,"text":"Eio 的架构","id":"eio-的架构"},{"level":2,"text":"结构化并发与 Switch","id":"结构化并发与-switch"},{"level":2,"text":"能力传递与依赖注入","id":"能力传递与依赖注入"},{"level":2,"text":"Fiber 间通信","id":"fiber-间通信"},{"level":2,"text":"多核并行与 Eio","id":"多核并行与-eio"},{"level":2,"text":"从 Lwt 迁移到 Eio","id":"从-lwt-迁移到-eio"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"效果处理器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/advanced-ocaml-programming/concurrency-effects/effect-handlers"},"next":{"title":"Opam 与 Dune 工具链","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/advanced-ocaml-programming/ecosystem/opam-dune-toolchain"}}